    "body": "I don't know if there's support for landing it, but in terms of API design it might be worth looking at things like https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Selection/getComposedRanges which take an array of shadow roots. There isn't a way to include all open shadow roots there - I wonder if that was a deliberate choice and if the reasons are documented.",
